            "review_title": "Review at Nathalie's Thai Restaurant",
            "review_text": "Tom H\nPerth, Australia43 contributions\n0\nThank you dinner\nDec 2019 • Family\nTook my Vietnamese family out to dinner last night as a thank you dinner. There were 7 of us and Quang (son in law) recommended This restaurant which had been voted in top 5 restaurants, continuously over past 12 years. \nWe shared 6 dishes from Soup. Green curry, fish, vegetables, etc with a light flowery rice. Each dish was cooked to perfection and having eaten Thai all around world. I was surprised at how tasty and excellence in all dishes. The service was fast, polite and at your side delivering dish after dish with extreme efficiency.\nImpressions on a Thai restaurant in middle of Ho Chi Minh??, ,, Fantastic and certainly will return and recommend\nRead more\nReview collected in partnership with this restaurant \nWritten December 30, 2019",
