            "review_text": "spktravels\nTallman, New York360 contributions\n0\nVery nice dinner\nDec 2019 • Family\nWe had a nice lunch at Nathalie’s several months ago and decided to try it again for dinner. \n\nDinner was equally wonderful. The restaurant remains clean and good looking while the staff is pleasant and well trained.\n\nWe had morning glories Thai style included large chunks of garlic and chili pepper. We also had a fried fish which was well prepared, delicious and had very few bones. \n\nThe restaurant was relatively busy but there are always available tables. This is a good sign.\nRead more\nWritten December 12, 2019",
