            "review_text": "Jan F\nHo Chi Minh City, Vietnam56 contributions\n0\nI don't usually like hot pot\nDec 2018\nWe went to Nathalie's for lunch today there were 7 of us in the party, we had a seafood fried rice and a mixed hot pot of beef, pork, shrimp and squid, hot pots like this aren't usually my favorites, I lie the rotary hot pots and some Korean bbq places, but this hot pot was very good the broth was tasty and I just enjoyed this place, the interior is above average and the service was great.\nRead more\nReview collected in partnership with this restaurant \nWritten December 4, 2018",
