            "review_title": "Review at Nathalie's Thai Restaurant",
            "review_text": "Sailight\nHo Chi Minh City, Vietnam21 contributions\n0\nExcellent location, prices, atmosphere and service\nFeb 2018 • Couples\nNathalie's has a special place in my heart because of the wonderful atmosphere. It's one of those restaurants that you can go to with a friend and stay for hours. You've a great view of phu my hung, and inside it's cozy. Honestly you can order a few items off of the appetizer menu that will knock your socks off and fill you up. The veggie curries are excellent. Wait staff speaks English well. Super reasonably priced, relaxed dining experience\nRead more\nWritten February 11, 2018",
